WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.046 --> 00:00:02.796
(haunting music)

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:08.280
- [Sarah] When I go down the slope,

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:09.740
it takes me three seconds to get

00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:11.211
from zero to 60 miles an hour.

00:00:11.211 --> 00:00:16.211
(dramatic music)
(skis whooshing)

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:19.970
I honestly can't explain
what it feels like,

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:22.210
even after 15 years of doing the sport.

00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:27.010
My name is Sarah Hendrickson,

00:00:27.010 --> 00:00:28.570
and I'm an Olympic ski jumper.

00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:36.750
Ski jumping is a sport where
I go down a two-track slope

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:41.500
at 55 miles an hour and,
when the slope ends,

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:46.067
I jump, flying about a football
field in length in the air.

00:00:46.067 --> 00:00:48.817
(dramatic music)

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:54.290
When I'm getting ready to go,
the smell is of the fresh air

00:00:54.290 --> 00:00:56.640
from the trees and the snow in the area

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.100
and the feeling of cold,
brisk air on my face.

00:01:01.530 --> 00:01:04.021
When I put my goggles on,
I know it's time to go.

00:01:04.021 --> 00:01:06.771
(dramatic music)

00:01:11.710 --> 00:01:13.700
My eyesight, when I'm
going down the slope,

00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:15.870
is right in front of the tips of my skis.

00:01:17.270 --> 00:01:19.280
My skis are bouncing up
and down in the track

00:01:19.280 --> 00:01:22.370
against the ice, it feels like clatter.

00:01:22.370 --> 00:01:24.150
If you hear it, it's like a rumble.

00:01:26.530 --> 00:01:28.410
The flight takes three seconds,

00:01:28.410 --> 00:01:31.870
but honestly time slows
down and it feels like

00:01:31.870 --> 00:01:34.090
an eternity where I get to enjoy flying.

00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:38.860
As I'm flying, I can't hear anything.

00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:40.870
It's completely silent all around.

00:01:42.840 --> 00:01:45.240
The wind on my body feels
like when you put your hand

00:01:45.240 --> 00:01:47.580
out of a car window
going 60 miles an hour.

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:50.090
Moving it up and down, you
can feel the lift and drag

00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:51.770
it has on your hand.

00:01:51.770 --> 00:01:54.170
That's like ski jumping
but for your whole body.

00:01:56.100 --> 00:01:58.320
As I'm flying, I'm totally alone.

00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:01.470
I'm in control of all my
senses and all my movements.

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:02.705
It's the best feeling in the world.

00:02:02.705 --> 00:02:05.455
(dramatic music)

00:02:13.509 --> 00:02:17.092
(electronic tones chiming)

